			64</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			Crates, <i>an Academic philosopher of Athens</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 1, 9, 34</span></i>.</div>
